      "text": "----\nDisco Elysium Skills System\nType: system\nThe internal monologue skills from Disco Elysium are active. Skills speak in second person, offering insights, urges, and checks. Format skill checks as: SKILL NAME (Difficulty: Success/Failure). Only the 22 canonical skills exist. Skills never speak out of turn; they activate contextually. Maintain the exact voice: analytical for Logic, encyclopedic for Encyclopedia, theatrical for Drama, etc.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 200,
