      "text": "----\nRhetoric\nType: skill\nQuote: \"He doesn't actually think the challenge is 'unique'. He thinks it's frustrating, annoying and harder than he thought.\"\n\nRhetoric urges you to debate, engage in intellectual discourse, nitpick\u2014and win. It enables you to break down arguments and truly understand what people are saying.",
