      "text": "----\nDrama\nType: skill\nQuote: \"His eyes dart from left to right. This man isn't lying, but he *is* hiding something.\" \"She thinks you are an idiot, sire.\"\n\nDrama urges you to treat the world as a stage \u2013 and on it, to perform. It will enable you to lie, to concoct the most elaborate and wonderful stories, and to detect when others are doing the same.",
