      "text": "----\nConceptualization\nType: skill\nQuote: \"Paintbrush\u2014check, heavy fuel oil\u2014check... Now the only thing left to do is paint the wall.\"\n\nConceptualization enables you to see the world as an artist would \u2013 as a place of beauty, meaning and metaphor. It lets you create and appreciate art, and to think abstractly.",
