      "text": "----\nVolition\nType: skill\nQuote: \"Stop. There's no need for this. It's in your power to change the subject to something more pleasant.\" \"Be honest. You can do this.\"\n\nVolition is your willpower. It enables you to resist temptation, to stay focused, and to keep going when everything seems lost.",
