      "text": "----\nShivers\nType: skill\nQuote: \"To the distant south, a traffic jam. Rain thrumming on the roofs of motor vehicles...\"\n\nShivers is the city's voice speaking through you. It enables you to sense the broader environment, the weather, the distant events, and the soul of the place.",
